# 17. One Important Exam Distinction

Don't confuse these three things:

### IPv4 routing

```text
OSPF
```

Your output:

```text
%OSPF-5-ADJCHG
Nbr 1.1.1.1
from LOADING to FULL
```

### IPv6 routing capability

```text
ipv6 unicast-routing
```

### IPv6 addressing

```text
ipv6 address 2001:db8:1:1::1/64
```

They are related, but they're **not the same thing**.

Think:

```text
IPv6 addressing
      ↓
ipv6 address ...

IPv6 routing capability
      ↓
ipv6 unicast-routing

IPv4 dynamic routing
      ↓
OSPF
```

